    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you go? Find out in Go Up, the relaxing and atmospheric idle game that never stops.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect dust, spice, chaos and more as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/93c5084d7128dcc5b894bbd653ae2f02.poster.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/93c5084d7128dcc5b894bbd653ae2f02.webm?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/93c5084d7128dcc5b894bbd653ae2f02.mp4?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaotic Event</strong>. Collect enough <strong>Dust</strong> and you\u2019ll earn a <strong>Golden Dust</strong> to spend on upgrading your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey through vast and varied environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/cb3844428c173364964ebcecd40927ad.poster.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/cb3844428c173364964ebcecd40927ad.webm?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/cb3844428c173364964ebcecd40927ad.mp4?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Travel through 11 unique and vibrant regions as you traverse the realms, ascending from the pits of \ud83d\udd25<strong>Tartarus</strong>\ud83d\udd25 through \u2740<strong>Elysium</strong>\u2740 and beyond into the  heavenly \u2727<strong>Cosmos</strong>\u2727.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you\u2019re not going up, you\u2019re going down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press any button to Go Up, but don\u2019t stop pressing, or you will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/2b66c7bd73d8ae18a2ce2a80fd57b855.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive skill tree offers over 70 unique skills to help you Go Up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve got \ud83e\uddf2<strong>Magnets</strong>\ud83e\uddf2. <br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\ud83d\ude80Boosters\ud83d\ude80</strong>.<br>We've got <strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fShields\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f.</strong><br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\u23ebAccelerators\u23eb</strong> and \ud83d\udeab\u23ec<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>\u23ec\ud83d\udeab. <br>And lots of other upgrades that you'll have to play the game to find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you can save up your <strong>Golden Dust</strong> for the ultimate purchase, the skill that lets you Go Up <i>automatically</i> without a single button press. True idle perfection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/15ee6e5b45d807c140e49eac42b5d13e.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player\u2019s high score to knock them off the leader board, exploding their ghost into valuable<strong> dust</strong> that you can collect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u266b \u266a \u266c<strong> Music to put you in the zone\u00a0</strong>\u266b \u266a \u266c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you go? Find out in Go Up, the relaxing and atmospheric idle game that never stops.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect dust, spice, chaos and more as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/93c5084d7128dcc5b894bbd653ae2f02.poster.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/93c5084d7128dcc5b894bbd653ae2f02.webm?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/93c5084d7128dcc5b894bbd653ae2f02.mp4?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaotic Event</strong>. Collect enough <strong>Dust</strong> and you\u2019ll earn a <strong>Golden Dust</strong> to spend on upgrading your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey through vast and varied environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/cb3844428c173364964ebcecd40927ad.poster.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/cb3844428c173364964ebcecd40927ad.webm?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/cb3844428c173364964ebcecd40927ad.mp4?t=1754280493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Travel through 11 unique and vibrant regions as you traverse the realms, ascending from the pits of \ud83d\udd25<strong>Tartarus</strong>\ud83d\udd25 through \u2740<strong>Elysium</strong>\u2740 and beyond into the  heavenly \u2727<strong>Cosmos</strong>\u2727.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you\u2019re not going up, you\u2019re going down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press any button to Go Up, but don\u2019t stop pressing, or you will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/2b66c7bd73d8ae18a2ce2a80fd57b855.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive skill tree offers over 70 unique skills to help you Go Up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve got \ud83e\uddf2<strong>Magnets</strong>\ud83e\uddf2. <br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\ud83d\ude80Boosters\ud83d\ude80</strong>.<br>We've got <strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fShields\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f.</strong><br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\u23ebAccelerators\u23eb</strong> and \ud83d\udeab\u23ec<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>\u23ec\ud83d\udeab. <br>And lots of other upgrades that you'll have to play the game to find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you can save up your <strong>Golden Dust</strong> for the ultimate purchase, the skill that lets you Go Up <i>automatically</i> without a single button press. True idle perfection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/15ee6e5b45d807c140e49eac42b5d13e.avif?t=1754280493\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player\u2019s high score to knock them off the leader board, exploding their ghost into valuable<strong> dust</strong> that you can collect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u266b \u266a \u266c<strong> Music to put you in the zone\u00a0</strong>\u266b \u266a \u266c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>",
